#20204
The Fen Hag's Hut~
   A hut of reeds and mud squats on a hummock above the water. Inside,
bundles of herbs and dead things hang from the roof, and a cauldron bubbles
with something grey. Little figures made of reeds and hair stand along a
shelf, each wearing a scrap of clothing from someone who went missing.
