#20206
Beneath the Water, a Drowned Street~
   You sink into the cold water and walk the drowned street. Doors hang
open. Weed grows from the windows. Drowned villagers go about their old
tasks in slow motion, mending nets that rot as they mend them, and they turn
their white faces toward you as you pass.
