#20210
The Gate of Stilthold~
   A town rises from the marsh on a forest of tarred stilts, its timber
walls studded with iron spikes. A drawbridge of planks hangs over the
causeway, let down only for the living. A great bronze bell hangs in a tower
above the gate, and a guard rings it every hundred heartbeats.
~
