#20211
Stilthold, the Plank Walk~
   Walkways of planks link the houses of Stilthold high above the water,
swaying gently on their ropes. Children are tied to their mothers with cords
so that they cannot fall. Lamps burn in every window, day and night, because
the grey lights fear true flame.
~
