#20212
Stilthold, the Reeve's Hall~
   A long hall on the highest stilts, where the reeve holds council beneath
a roof of reed thatch. Maps of the marsh are spread on the table, and every
drowned village is marked with a black stone. There are more black stones
than there are villages left.
